(a) whether the proposal of Six-lane National Highway from Visakhapatnam to Bhogapuram International Airport  has been approved by Government, if so, the present status of the project, Detailed Project Report (DPR), the estimated cost and the implementing agency;
(b) whether the project is being executed under the Ministry of Road Transport and Highways/National Highways Authority of India (NHAI); and
(c) if so, the reasons for the delay, if any, in completion of the six-lane National Highway and the target date for completion and commissioning of the proposed six-lane National Highway for the benefit of air travellers and the residents of the Visakhapatnam region?

(a) whether Government of India is promoting rooftop solar systems on Government buildings in Odisha;
(b) the number of Government buildings covered so far;
(c) the targets and roadmap fixed for the State of Odisha; and
(d) the details thereof?

(a) whether National Data on blood lipids containing fats including cholesterol, triglycerides in blood stream and blood tissues has been published by ICMR-INDIA B recently;
(b) whether the glycaemic status, obesity, hyper-tension was very common and found in urban blood samples data;
(c) if so, the details thereof;
(d) whether "good cholesterol or HDL" the protective cholesterol which help fat from blood stream were the single most common abnormality affecting majority of adults in the samples;
(e) if so, the details thereof, State-wise; and
(f) the details of the roadmap of Government to tackle this problem?

(a) whether the Central Government has any scheme(s) to promote bamboo-based  industries in the State of Odisha;
(b) the Central  assistance provided to such industries during the last three years;
(c) the steps taken to enhance employment through bamboo-based enterprises in the State of Odisha; and
(d) the details thereof?

(a) whether Government is supporting restoration of traditional ponds and water bodies in the State of Odisha;
(b) if so, the funds released during the last three years; and
(c) the number of water bodies restored till date?

(a) whether the Ministry has any proposal for asset monetization from railway stations in the country;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) whether the proposal has been sent to the Public Private Partnership Approval Committee (PPPAC) for the same; and
(d) if so, the number of stations and the expected revenue generation from such asset monetization from the railway stations in Odisha, the details thereof?

(a) whether the Ministry has plan to increase the subsidy for installation of roof top solar power in order to reduce dependence on coal energy and hydro electricity for household consumption in the country;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the allocation of fund by the Ministry for the above said project during the year 2024-25, 2025-26 and 2026-27 to the State of Odisha; and
(d) the number of beneficiaries of the State during the said period?

(a) whether the Ministry of AYUSH is planning to open wellness centres at the district headquarters of Odisha to provide Ayurvedic treatment and traditional medicine to the patients at an affordable price;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) how many AYUSH wellness centres are existing at present in the State of Odisha; and
(d) the details of any new AYUSH wellness centre to be opened in the State during current financial year?

(a) the present status of the proposed expansion and upgradation of Rourkela airport in the State of Odisha;
(b) the runway extension, terminal development, installation of night landing facilities and other infrastructure required for all weather operation;
(c) whether Government proposes to equip the above said airport with night landing capabilities, ILS and other modern navigation for operation of larger aircraft and enhanced flight connectivity;
(d) the time bound action plan for completion and operationalization of the above said airport; and
(e) the details thereof?

(a) whether the Ministry of Railways has plan to create New Railway Divisions in the country during current financial year;
(b) if so, the details of these divisions;
(c) whether Government will create a new Railway Division by merging Rourkela-Chakradharpur division; and
(d) if so, the details thereof?

(a) the allocation of funds for construction of Paika Rebellion Memorial at Barunei in the State of Odisha;
(b) the name of person who has laid the foundation stone of this memorial and when; and
(c) the details of progress of this project and by when this project is likely to be completed?

(a) the date on which the Pradhan Mantri Garib Kalyan Anna Yojana was launched by Government;
(b) the number of beneficiaries at the time when it was launched;
(c) the number of people benefitted under PMGKAY, State-wise;
(d) the expenditure during the year 2025-2026 and the budgetary allocation for the scheme during the year 2026-27; and
(e) the data regarding the quantity of rice, wheat and other grains provided to the beneficiaries at present, State-wise?

(a) whether Government has  any plan  to open new regular airport at Rourkela in the State of Odisha under UDAN  scheme;
(b) if so, whether any proposal has sent by Government of Odisha to the Central Government in this regards ;
(c) the details thereof; 
(d) the proposed cost of opening regular airport at Rourkela and  the amount of money sanctioned  for the same; and
(e) the details thereof?

(a) the year in which the decision was taken for the construction of Talcher- Bimalagarh railway line along with the cost of the project at the initial stage;
(b)  the year by which the above said project is likely to be made operational;
(c) the present status of the said project and the total area of Government land, forest land and private land acquired for that particular project; and
(d)  the quantum of fund sanctioned and the amount of money spent on this said project till now; and 
(e) the year in which the project will be operational?

(a) how many Central Universities, Kendriya Vidyalayas, IITs, IIMs and Research Institutes and other Academies under Education departments of Union Government are functioning in the State of Odisha and district-wise list of such institutions;
(b) what are the sanctioned strength of teaching, non-teaching staffs and research scholars of these institutions;
(c) the number of regular vacancies in different departments, institution-wise in the State of Odisha; and
(d) the details thereof?

(a) whether there is any proposal to open satellite centre of AIIMS at Rourkela in the State of Odisha;
(b) if so, when this satellite centre of AIIMS at Rourkela is going to be made functional;
(c) whether Government has allocated any fund for the above satellite centre at Rourkela; 
(d) what is the cost of such satellite centre at Bhubaneswar AIIMS; and
(e) the details thereof?

(a) the debt burden of the country as on 31st March, 2026 and the projected debt burden by the end of the financial year 2026-27;
(b) out of the total debt burden, the amount of foreign debt as on 31st March, 2026 and the projected foreign debt burden by the end of the current financial year; and
(c) the interest and the principal paid on the loans by Government from the financial year 2020-21 to 2025-26 and the budget estimate in this regard during current financial year?
